				<span class="et_pb_image_wrap "><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="1024" height="1536" src="https://nou.edu.ng/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Vice-Chancellor-of-National-Open-University-of-Nigeria.png" alt="" title="Vice Chancellor of National Open University of Nigeria" srcset="https://nou.edu.ng/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Vice-Chancellor-of-National-Open-University-of-Nigeria.png 1024w, https://nou.edu.ng/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Vice-Chancellor-of-National-Open-University-of-Nigeria-980x1470.png 980w, https://nou.edu.ng/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Vice-Chancellor-of-National-Open-University-of-Nigeria-480x720.png 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 980px) 980px, (min-width: 981px) 1024px, 100vw" class="wp-image-12135" /></span>
